================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS
================================================================================

RetroFrame bundles the following libraries. The same list is shown inside the app
under Settings -> About RetroFrame, so that anyone who receives only the APK can
see it too.

This list was checked against the contents of a built release APK, not only
against the dependency declarations. That matters: Guava arrives transitively
through Media3 rather than being asked for by name, and R8 renames its packages
on the way in, so it is easy both to miss when reading build.gradle.kts and to
wrongly conclude is absent when reading the APK.

